  "bodyHash": "2Yhj4C/gMJM=",
  "content": "<h3><strong>《全精灵模组》是《全模组10》与Cobblemon的完全整合版！</strong>它将400多个你熟悉且喜爱的模组与完整的宝可梦体验融为一体。<br><br></h3><h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1356598/description_d1ad4a8a-8508-44e4-8c2e-d550d206988a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"><br><br><strong>Cobblemon + ATM10：</strong><br>经典的ATM10进程系统，现已加入高品质宝可梦任务与机制。</h4><h4><strong>定制内容：</strong><br>探索专为本整合包设计的自定义训练师对战与独特世界建筑。</h4><h4><strong>持续开发：</strong><br>定期更新新增任务、训练师与特殊生成机制。</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1356598/description_ff818f5f-0814-4c4e-9018-8b0aa3b17dca.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></p><h4><strong>自定义精灵球配方：</strong><br>重制的合成路径需要模组专属材料。通过自动化生产线批量制造高阶精灵球。</h4><h4><strong>ATM之星：</strong><br>终极终局目标。制作星辰需要同时精通复杂科技/魔法模组与稀有宝可梦相关资源。</h4><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/allthemods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_54901d94-6ad2-4408-869f-27ba9026b292.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AllTheMods/All-the-mons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_b33feea2-9c55-4bae-9b5d-fff3e2ac52db.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/81cdCtF5TXY\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PZD6Wsi-GA4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/orAUFev4cdY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8RWRYB75IVo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br>《全模组》系列</strong>最初只是我为几位朋友制作的私人整合包，后来逐渐发展成为众人期待的作品！它包含其他主流大型整合包的所有基础要素，同时巧妙融合了许多新兴或小众模组。<br><br>本次最大变更是我们已迁移至<strong>NeoForge</strong>并升级至<strong>1.21版本</strong>。随着模组更新，敬请期待更多内容迭代！</p><p>在<strong>《全精灵模组》</strong>中，我们将延续传统，在保持稳定性的前提下持续加入大量新模组。</p><p><strong>“全精灵模组”真的包含</strong><strong>所有</strong><strong>精灵吗？不，当然不是。只包含目前已发布的精灵……</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
